      "confidence": "Weak",
      "cwe_id": [79],
      "note": "Output is a string of `--brand-N[-ink|-soft|-line]:#RRGGBB;` CSS custom property declarations. Every value is gated through `Storefronts::Palette.sanitize_hex!` which raises on anything that isn't a canonical hex color (#rgb, #rrggbb, #rrggbbaa). The primary + secondary palette names are validated at the model layer via `inclusion: { in: PALETTES }` on Accounts::Branding, and the service's .for() method falls back to DEFAULT when the name isn't in the frozen PALETTES hash. No user-controlled string can ever reach this string interpolation."
    },
